{"seq":1,"slug":"destruction-performance","title":"破坏的性能与预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/practice/destruction-performance","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"破坏的性能与预算\">破坏的性能与预算</h1><p>破坏系统在 profiler 里长这样：绝大多数帧它是一条贴着底的平线，然后某一帧突然窜起一根尖峰——那是玩家扔了颗手雷。破坏的性能问题从来不是「平均开销高」，而是「峰值把某一帧的预算打爆、造成可见卡顿」。所以破坏的性能工程，本质是<strong>削峰</strong>：把爆炸那一帧的瞬时开销摊平、限量、降级到能塞进帧预算里。本篇讲破坏场景下具体怎么核算和削峰；通用的 profiling 方法、多线程、内存管理请回链<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/\">性能优化</a>，不在此重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>破坏的性能工程本质是<strong>削峰</strong>。破坏在 profiler 里是一条贴底的平线加一根偶发尖峰，问题从不是平均开销高，而是峰值把某一帧的预算打爆造成可见卡顿。核心模型是把破坏单帧开销拆成三块相加：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>destroy</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fracture</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>solve</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{destroy}} = T_{\\text{fracture}} + N_{\\text{active}}\\cdot c_{\\text{solve}} + T_{\\text{propagate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">destroy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fracture</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">solve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（运行时切割 + 活跃碎块求解 + 应力传播），它直接给出三个旋钮——消掉运行时切割、限制活跃碎块数、限制每帧传播量。削峰的主要手段不是加速单次计算，而是<strong>限量与分摊</strong>：把大规模坍塌摊到多帧「慢慢演」既省峰值又更真实，但须保证受击点的第一响应在当帧完成。度量上必须用<strong>逐帧峰值</strong>而非平均帧时，并在满负载场景压测最坏情况。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把破坏放进帧预算\">把破坏放进帧预算</h2><p>一个 60 FPS 的游戏每帧只有 16.7 毫秒，其中物理通常只分到 2–4 毫秒，而破坏又只是物理的一部分。所以要先给破坏定一个明确的毫秒预算，比如「任何单帧破坏开销不超过 2ms」，再倒推所有参数。帧预算的通用概念见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/foundations/frame-budget\">性能优化 · 帧预算</a>。</p>\n<p>破坏单帧开销可以粗略拆成三块相加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>destroy</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fracture</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>solve</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{destroy}} = T_{\\text{fracture}} + N_{\\text{active}} \\cdot c_{\\text{solve}} + T_{\\text{propagate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">destroy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fracture</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">solve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fracture</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fracture}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fracture</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是运行时切割开销（预断裂方案下近似为零）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{active}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是活跃碎块数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>solve</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{solve}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">solve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每个活跃刚体的平均求解成本、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{propagate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是应力传播开销。这个式子直接告诉我们三个削峰旋钮：用<a href=\"../foundations/prefractured-vs-dynamic\">预断裂</a>消掉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fracture</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fracture}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fracture</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、限制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{active}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、限制每帧传播量压住 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{propagate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主要开销来源与对策\">主要开销来源与对策</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>开销来源</th>\n<th>峰值诱因</th>\n<th>削峰对策</th>\n<th>相关篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运行时切割</td>\n<td>复杂网格帧内 Voronoi</td>\n<td>改用预断裂/多级烘焙</td>\n<td><a href=\"../foundations/prefractured-vs-dynamic\">预断裂与动态</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>刚体求解</td>\n<td>活跃碎块数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{active}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 暴增</td>\n<td>数量上限、成簇、激进休眠</td>\n<td><a href=\"../simulation/debris-management\">碎屑管理</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束求解</td>\n<td>大簇同时解体，约束数飙升</td>\n<td>批处理断裂、限制每帧解体层数</td>\n<td><a href=\"../simulation/joint-constraints\">约束与连接</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应力传播</td>\n<td>一帧内连锁坍塌太多层</td>\n<td>限制每帧传播迭代/断边数</td>\n<td><a href=\"../fracture/stress-propagation\">应力传播</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碰撞对爆炸</td>\n<td>密集碎块 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 接触</td>\n<td>宽相加速、极小碎屑不互碰</td>\n<td><a href=\"../simulation/debris-physics\">碎块物理</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成/销毁分配</td>\n<td>瞬间 new 几十个刚体</td>\n<td>对象池预分配</td>\n<td><a href=\"../simulation/debris-management\">碎屑管理</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表几乎是前几章所有内容的性能视角复盘。核心结论是：<strong>削峰几乎全靠限量与分摊</strong>，而不是让单次计算更快。让一栋楼「花三秒慢慢塌」而不是「一帧塌完」，既省了峰值又更真实，是削峰与观感双赢的典型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间摊分-把峰值摊到多帧\">时间摊分：把峰值摊到多帧</h2><p>破坏最有效的削峰手段，是承认「破坏不必在一帧内完成」。真实坍塌本就是渐次发生的，因此可以刻意把工作摊到多帧：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[大规模破坏事件] --&gt; B{单帧全处理?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 摊分| C[本帧: 处理受击点附近&lt;br/&gt;限量断边+释放]&#10;  C --&gt; D[下一帧: 传播扩散一层]&#10;  D --&gt; E[再下一帧: 继续扩散]&#10;  E --&gt; F{还有待处理?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| D&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[破坏收敛]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| H[峰值爆表, 卡顿]\">flowchart TD\n  A[大规模破坏事件] --&gt; B{单帧全处理?}\n  B --&gt;|否, 摊分| C[本帧: 处理受击点附近&lt;br/&gt;限量断边+释放]\n  C --&gt; D[下一帧: 传播扩散一层]\n  D --&gt; E[再下一帧: 继续扩散]\n  E --&gt; F{还有待处理?}\n  F --&gt;|是| D\n  F --&gt;|否| G[破坏收敛]\n  B --&gt;|是| H[峰值爆表, 卡顿]</pre><p>具体做法包括：每帧限制新激活的碎块数（超出的排队到下一帧）、限制应力传播迭代次数（<a href=\"../fracture/stress-propagation\">应力传播</a>里已提）、把切割/网格生成放到后台线程隔帧完成。摊分的代价是破坏「演」得稍慢，但对大规模坍塌这反而是加分项。关键是保证受击点的<strong>第一响应</strong>（玩家直接打中处立即有反馈）在当帧完成，后续扩散才摊分——否则会有「打了没反应」的延迟感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多线程与数据布局\">多线程与数据布局</h2><p>破坏天然适合并行。<a href=\"../simulation/debris-physics\">碎块物理</a>里的 island 分组让不同 island 可以派给不同工作线程独立求解；离线的<a href=\"../fracture/voronoi-fracture\">Voronoi 碎裂</a>与运行时的批量碎屑更新也都是数据并行的好对象。把这些切成任务丢进 job 系统，是现代引擎处理破坏峰值的标准做法，通用机制见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/multithreading-jobs\">性能优化 · 多线程与 Job 系统</a>。</p>\n<p>数据布局同样影响峰值。碎块数据若分散在堆各处，遍历上百个碎块求解会疯狂 cache miss。把碎块的位姿、速度、质量等热数据连续存放（数据导向布局），能显著提升求解吞吐，原理见 <a href=\"../../entity-component-system/data-layout/memory-cache-locality\">ECS · 内存与缓存局部性</a>。这与<a href=\"../simulation/debris-management\">碎屑管理</a>里的对象池天然契合——池本身就是一块连续内存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量与定位\">度量与定位</h2><p>削峰的前提是能看见峰值。破坏性能问题必须用<strong>逐帧峰值</strong>而非平均帧时来度量——平均帧时会把爆炸那一帧的卡顿稀释掉，看着一切正常。实践中应在 profiler 里专门盯破坏相关的物理标记（活跃刚体数、约束数、求解耗时）随事件的曲线，找出「哪种破坏、多少碎块会打爆预算」，再据此设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与传播上限。压测方法是构造最坏场景（同时引爆多个大结构）看单帧峰值是否越界。通用的 profiling 工具与方法见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/practice/profiling-tools\">性能优化 · 性能剖析工具</a>。一个常见教训是：QA 在空场景测破坏一切正常，实战中破坏叠加满场角色、粒子、AI 才暴露预算越界——所以压测必须在满负载场景下做。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>破坏的性能问题是峰值而非均值；性能工程的本质是削峰——限量与分摊，而非加速单次计算。</li>\n<li>单帧开销近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fracture</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>solve</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fracture}} + N_{\\text{active}} c_{\\text{solve}} + T_{\\text{propagate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fracture</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">solve</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对应预断裂、限碎块数、限传播三旋钮。</li>\n<li>把大规模坍塌摊到多帧「慢慢演」既削峰又更真实，但须保证受击点第一响应在当帧完成。</li>\n<li>靠 island 并行、job 系统、连续数据布局提升吞吐；对象池消除分配尖峰。</li>\n<li>必须用逐帧峰值度量，并在满负载场景压测最坏破坏，避免空场景假阴性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>限量的实现细节：<a href=\"../simulation/debris-management\">碎屑管理与 LOD</a>；传播上限：<a href=\"../fracture/stress-propagation\">应力传播</a></li>\n<li>网络侧的额外开销：<a href=\"destruction-netcode\">网络同步</a></li>\n<li>跨库：通用剖析与预算方法，见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/practice/profiling-tools\">性能优化 · 性能剖析工具</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"破坏的性能与预算","id":"破坏的性能与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"把破坏放进帧预算","id":"把破坏放进帧预算"},{"level":2,"text":"主要开销来源与对策","id":"主要开销来源与对策"},{"level":2,"text":"时间摊分：把峰值摊到多帧","id":"时间摊分-把峰值摊到多帧"},{"level":2,"text":"多线程与数据布局","id":"多线程与数据布局"},{"level":2,"text":"度量与定位","id":"度量与定位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"碎屑管理与 LOD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/simulation/debris-management"},"next":{"title":"破坏的网络同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/practice/destruction-netcode"}}